# =============================================================================
# 🎯 TILT SDK - MANIFEST-DRIVEN CONFIG GENERATOR
# =============================================================================
# Path: .tilt/provisioner/orchestrator/generators/manifest_resource.star
# Purpose: Per-manifest config generation as Tilt resources
# =============================================================================
#
# Creates individual Tilt resources for each manifest that trigger all
# config generators (tsconfig, dockerfile, vite, npmrc, etc.) for that
# specific service.
#
# Benefits:
# - Granular tracking (see "my-service-config-gen" in Tilt UI)
# - Efficient updates (only regenerate changed manifests)
# - Better dependency management (explicit resource deps)
# - Cleaner architecture (manifest → resource → 10 generators)
# =============================================================================

